[Original customer statement]
Hello, I am C-56562. On 2026-11-09, I placed an order on your platform for one box of infant formula milk powder (B-23979 batch, 6-can pack, actually paid 1280 yuan), and it was delivered in the afternoon on 2026-09-03. That evening, when I opened the can and mixed it, I found the milk powder was clumped and had a rancid smell. My child drank about half a cup and vomited three times in the middle of the night. The next day we went to the community health service center; the doctor said it was an acute gastrointestinal reaction and told us to stop using this milk powder for now.
I contacted logistics. A logistics dispatcher replied that the truck had been stuck at the transfer yard for nearly 9 hours, and the cold-chain carriage had lost power midway; he could not say how long the outage lasted. I request a full refund of 1280 yuan, and you must also bear the 286 yuan examination fee for my child's medical visit.

[Customer service verification notes]
1. The customer has uploaded photos of the opened can; the clumping is obvious, and the packaging batch matches the outbound record;
2. The customer provided a screenshot of the medical record; the date matches the complaint date;
3. The logistics side confirmed that the cold-chain temperature record for this trip is missing for 9 hours; the dispatcher's oral account matches the backend tracking;
4. According to after-sales rule 4.1: for the food category, and where customer feedback involves personal discomfort, the case must be transferred to manual review, and automatic refund does not apply; in addition, because the food has been opened, exchange and reshipment are not supported, and only refund processing is performed, with the refund amount capped at the actual paid amount of 1280 yuan;
5. Severity score: food category 2 points + involves personal discomfort 2 points + single actual payment over 1000 yuan 1 point = 5 points (scale: 0-1 minor, 2 general, 3-4 severe, 5 and above very severe).

[Unrelated item] Note: TK-20261103-9543 is the customer's inquiry from last week about the arrival time of stroller accessories; it is unrelated to this order. Do not merge it for processing again.
